  "body": "Skip to main content menu search help_outline Dresslikemommy 124884876 arrow_drop_down Overview Notifications 2 Products & store Products Shipping and returns Store quality Reviews Creative content Product Studio Video assets Marketing Ad campaigns Promotions Automated discounts Marketing methods Analytics Summary Products Pricing Online store Custom reports Settings General Business info Data sources Add-ons Access and services Marketing methods For online store Active Shopping ads Advertise your products on all Google Ads channels, including YouTube, Search, and Discover. You only pay when people click on your ads, and you can stop your campaign whenever you want. Learn more about Shopping ads\u2060\u200e Manage View campaigns Active Free listings Your products can show organically across Google. Learn more about free listings\u2060\u200e Free listings enabled: On For physical stores Setup required Local inventory ads Let nearby shoppers know your store has the products they're looking for while they search on Google. Learn more about local inventory ads\u2060\u200e On average, retailers using local inventory ads and Shopping ads together see +21% store visits and drive +9% online conversion rates for in-store products. Set up Setup required Free local listings Show your in-store products to customers across Google. Learn more about free local listings\u2060\u200e Retailers that display their local inventory can see on average 16% more impressions with their organic shopping offers on Google. Set up You can find additional marketing methods on the Add-ons page. Learn more about marketing methods Privacy Policy \u00b7 Terms of Service \u00b7 Program Policies",
